\subsection{Research attempt}
\paragraph{Model, date and investigated scope.}
OpenAI GPT-6 Astra (configured model \texttt{gpt-6-astra}), ultra reasoning; generated 11 October 2026. Constructs smooth small-energy graphs with unbounded slope, invalidating a direct energy-to-Lipschitz continuation argument.

\paragraph{Sources and literature check.}
